senses.gloss:
√1śī (śéte [see 628-9]; śiśyé; áśayiṣṭa;
śayiṣyáte, -ti; śeṣyáte, -ti; śayitá; śáyitum;
śayitvā́; -śáyya).
 —1. lie still;
lie;
 —2. sleep. [w. śé-te, cf. κεῖ-ται,
‘lies’: cf. also κοί-τη, ‘bed.’]
+ adhi, lie in or on; dwell in.
+ anu, lie down after another.
+ ā, lie in.
+ upa, lie by.
+ sam, be undecided or in doubt. [lit.
‘lie together’: metaphor unclear.]
